<div class="container container-spacing light-bg" name="species-information">
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Species information</h2>
    <div>
      <h4>&nbsp;</h4>
      <h4>Identification</h4>
      <p>
        The stems of heather are woody and coarse, sometimes clumped together and close to the ground in exposed areas.
        The delicate pink flowers grow loosely up the stem and the short, narrow leaves are borne in rows.
      </p>
      <hr />
      <h4>Distribution</h4>
      <p>Common in Scotland</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
